   <dmdSec ID="DMD_icict_33514">
      <mdWrap MDTYPE="MODS">
         <xmlData xmlns:mods="http://www.loc.gov/mods/v3" xsi:schemaLocation="http://www.loc.gov/mods/v3 http://www.loc.gov/standards/mods/v3/mods-3-1.xsd">
            <mods:mods xsi:schemaLocation="http://www.loc.gov/mods/v3 http://www.loc.gov/standards/mods/v3/mods-3-1.xsd">
               <mods:name>
                  <mods:role>
                     <mods:roleTerm type="text">author</mods:roleTerm>
                  </mods:role>
                  <mods:namePart>Silva, Marcus Tulius T.</mods:namePart>
               </mods:name>
               <mods:name>
                  <mods:role>
                     <mods:roleTerm type="text">author</mods:roleTerm>
                  </mods:role>
                  <mods:namePart>Curi, André Land</mods:namePart>
               </mods:name>
               <mods:extension>
                  <mods:dateAccessioned encoding="iso8601">2019-06-16T03:07:13Z</mods:dateAccessioned>
               </mods:extension>
               <mods:extension>
                  <mods:dateAvailable encoding="iso8601">2019-06-16T03:07:13Z</mods:dateAvailable>
               </mods:extension>
               <mods:originInfo>
                  <mods:dateIssued encoding="iso8601">2004</mods:dateIssued>
               </mods:originInfo>
               <mods:identifier type="citation">SILVA., Marcus Tulius T.; CURI, André Landi. Blindness and total ophthalmoplegia after aesthetic polymethylmethacrylate injection. Arquivos Brasileiros de Neuropsiquiatria, Brasil, v. 62, n. 3B, p. 873-874, 2004.</mods:identifier>
               <mods:identifier type="issn">0004-282X</mods:identifier>
               <mods:identifier type="uri">https://arca.fiocruz.br/handle/icict/33514</mods:identifier>
               <mods:identifier type="doi">10.1590/S0004-282X2004000500025</mods:identifier>
               <mods:identifier type="eissn">1678-4227</mods:identifier>
               <mods:abstract>A injeção de polimetilmetacrilato (PMMA) é prática difundida na medicina estética como medida rejuvenecedora. No entanto, a injeção facial do PMMA carreia sérios riscos, especialmente se realizada na região glabelar. Descrevemos o caso de uma mulher que imediatamente após injeção glabelar de PMMA apresentou amaurose e oftalmoplegia total, revendo ainda a literatura pertinente.</mods:abstract>
               <mods:language>
                  <mods:languageTerm authority="rfc3066">eng</mods:languageTerm>
               </mods:language>
               <mods:accessCondition type="useAndReproduction">open access</mods:accessCondition>
               <mods:titleInfo>
                  <mods:title>Blindness and total ophthalmoplegia after aesthetic polymethylmethacrylate injection: case report Amaurose e oftalmoplegia total após injeção facial de polimetilmetacrilato: relato de caso</mods:title>
               </mods:titleInfo>
               <mods:genre>journal article</mods:genre>
            </mods:mods>
         </xmlData>
      </mdWrap>
   </dmdSec>
